  "body": "## T\u00f3m t\u1eaft\nPR n\u00e0y ch\u1ec9 th\u00eam t\u1ec7p d\u01b0\u1edbi `ops/land/`:\n- `ops/land/pr1267-wp1252-land-evidence.yaml` + `ops/land/pr1267-wp1252-provenance/` (SHA256SUMS ki\u1ec3m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c).\n- `ops/land/pr1277-wp1272-land-evidence.yaml` + `ops/land/pr1277-wp1272-provenance/`.\n\n## B\u1ed1n m\u1ed1c \u00a710.2.2 tr\u00ean \u0111\u00fang merge SHA\n| Packet | Merge | run | checkout | workflow_definition | gate_output |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| #1252 | `27fd808` (gate 42360967767) | passed | passed | passed (wd-run 42467652116) | passed |\n| #1272 | `c15603d` (gate 42439410815) | passed | passed | passed (wd-run 42467654305) | passed |\n\nM\u1ed7i wd-run \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c gh\u00e9p v\u1edbi run_id t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed1i chi\u1ebfu n\u1ed9i dung artifact `wd.json`, kh\u00f4ng d\u1ef1a v\u00e0o th\u1ee9 t\u1ef1 dispatch.\n\n## V\u00ec sao `landed: false`\nC\u1ea3 hai h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 cho `kiem-dong-wp` rc 12, thi\u1ebfu D2: nghi\u1ec7m thu ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7.\n- **#1252:**\n  - A10 (lane Windows t\u1eadp trung tr\u00ean m\u00e1y ch\u1ee7 kho) ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 l\u1eddi thu\u1eadt l\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a phi\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec1u ph\u1ed1i; log n\u1eb1m tr\u00ean m\u00e1y \u0111\u00f3.\n  - A14: \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn `launcher.py` th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ecdi ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 trong l\u1eddi khai.\n  - `launcher-windows` [42360967762](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/actions/runs/42360967762) tr\u00ean ch\u00ednh `27fd808` l\u00e0 FAILURE (`r1252_ghi_de_dich_truc_tiep SAI giet 0/1`). L\u1ed7i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c b\u1eb1ng #1272: run [42439410853](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/actions/runs/42439410853) tr\u00ean `c15603d` cho `520/520`. Vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ee7 cho \u00a710.2.4 hay ch\u01b0a l\u00e0 quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh c\u1ee7a ch\u1ee7 kho.\n- **#1272:** A1 (\u0111o tr\u00ean Windows tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi v\u00e1) ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 l\u1eddi thu\u1eadt l\u1ea1i. CI Windows sau merge \u0111\u00e3 \u0111o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00f3 nh\u00e3n posix: `KHONG DO DUOC tren nen nay`.\n\nHai h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e2ng l\u00ean `landed: true` khi phi\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec1u ph\u1ed1i g\u1eedi nguy\u00ean v\u0103n c\u00e1c log tr\u00ean `tra-luat-win` v\u00e0o provenance, ho\u1eb7c khi ch\u1ee7 kho quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\u00e1c.\n\n## Ki\u1ec3m\n- `land_evidence_nguon`: \u0110\u1ea0T cho c\u1ea3 2 h\u1ed3 s\u01a1.\n- `kiem_ho_so_land`: 54/54, rc 0. Hai h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 m\u1edbi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u1ecf qua v\u00ec `landed: false`.\n- `doctrine-scan`: rc 0.\n- `git diff --check`: rc 0.\n- `sha256sum -c`: kh\u1edbp, ki\u1ec3m tr\u00ean m\u1ed9t clone m\u1edbi.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxraXfMD1t2FJLzzGDr4)_",
